ocus on supporting the qualified dietitian and following approved care plans, rather than independently prescribing therapeutic diets."}]},{"heading":"Food Science & Food Safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food composition"},{"text":"Food processing"},{"text":"Food preservation"},{"text":"Food spoilage"},{"text":"Food microbiology"},{"text":"Food contamination"},{"text":"Food adulteration"},{"text":"Food labelling"},{"text":"Food hygiene"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GMP"},{"text":"GHP"},{"text":"HACCP"},{"text":"Food-storage practices"},{"text":"Temperature control"},{"text":"Cross-contamination prevention"}]}]},{"heading":"Digital & Nutrition Tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Word"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nutrition analysis software"},{"text":"Food composition databases"},{"text":"Electronic health records"},{"text":"Hospital information systems"},{"text":"Meal-planning software"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Excel analytics"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"R/Python fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use these for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Nutrition surveys"},{"text":"Dietary analysis"},{"text":"Population nutrition"},{"text":"Meal-plan comparison"},{"text":"Research data"}]}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Food Composition Database"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a database containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food"},{"text":"Serving size"},{"text":"Calories"},{"text":"Protein"},{"text":"Carbohydrates"},{"text":"Fat"},{"text":"Fibre"},{"text":"Vitamins"},{"text":"Minerals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build an interactive Excel/Power BI dashboard."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Meal Planning & Nutritional Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Create sample meal plans for different non-clinical scenarios, such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Student"},{"text":"Office worker"},{"text":"Athlete"},{"text":"Older adult"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Calories"},{"text":"Protein"},{"text":"Carbohydrates"},{"text":"Fat"},{"text":"Fibre"},{"text":"Micronutrients"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Document assumptions clearly."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Community Nutrition Survey"},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct a structured survey on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dietary habits"},{"text":"Meal patterns"},{"text":"Food choices"},{"text":"Nutrition awareness"},{"text":"Food-label reading"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze results using:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel/R/Python + Power BI"}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Digital Nutrition Assessment & Meal Planning Support System"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a system containing:"},{"type":"h","text":"User Information"},{"type":"h","text":"Dietary History"},{"type":"h","text":"Food Database"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutritional Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Meal Planning Support"},{"type":"h","text":"Progress Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Features:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food database"},{"text":"Nutrient calculator"},{"text":"Meal planner"},{"text":"Dietary-record management"},{"text":"Nutrition dashboard"},{"text":"Educational content"},{"text":"Progress tracking"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For clinical use, the system should be positioned as a decision-support/administrative tool for qualified professionals, not as an autonomous diagnostic or treatment system."}]},{"heading":"Specialization Choices","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialization","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Clinical Nutrition"},{"text":"Hospital and healthcare nutrition"}],[{"te